delim-one-name
owner: fable-5.1 session 53f400ad
started: 2026-09-16
what: the operator's ask — `shiftIn` is a name for a thing that already
  has one. Overloading proved out (both shapes resolve: a prompt in the
  first clause picks the primitive, a lambda picks the evidence one), so
  the typed door reuses `shift`, `shift0`, `control`, `control0`,
  `abort`, and the `In` suffixes go.
files: src/main/scala/Delim.scala, src/test/scala/TestDelim.scala,
  docs/typepedia.md, CHANGELOG.md
